{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011pEwDbspNuChv9NmKu6oMN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-20\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **diag_001** (negative): Specification-layer 歧义（conditional precedence）比 linguistic-layer 歧义（scopal）导致更高的 agent 安全违规率，差异≥15pp 且 pairwise 显著。机制：规则冲突需要 agent 做隐式优先级假设，这种推理比句法解析更容易出错。 ← 基于 mvp_001\\\\n  [clause_templates_diag001](/api/workspace-files/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/diag_001/data/clause_templates_diag001.json)\\\\n- **mvp_001** (negative): 不同类型的语言歧义（scopal/lexical/incompleteness）在 agent 策略文档中导致可量化区分的安全违规率差异（type effect）。预测: scopal 违规率最高, lexical 最低。omnibus p&lt;0.05 + pairwise Cramér's V≥0.20 即为 pass。\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 0 / 负向 2 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\n（无服务器配置）\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 714, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NHKacRRZ1UkDoBTMKDamfL","session_id":"759fb270-c694-4a1e-95d0-1940781c5183","uuid":"1b66d0b5-0e5c-4dbc-942d-776a031b5825","timestamp":"2026-05-20T12:20:13.722Z"}
